        "searchDiscoveryDescription": "Our advanced search system allows users to browse gyms and coaches with filters such as location, city, or name, making it easy to find the right fit.",
        "communicationTitle": "Communication System",
        "communicationDescription": "Built-in private chat and real-time notifications ensure seamless interaction between gyms and coaches without leaving the platform.",
        "aiFeaturesTitle": "AI Features",
        "aiFeaturesDescription": "GymSpot integrates AI to enhance your experience. From general fitness knowledge to platform-aware smart recommendations (RAG), our AI assistant helps you understand job posts, coaches, gyms, and applicants better.",
